# Accepted exceptions for the hardened-airflow Trivy gate
# (.github/workflows/airflow.yml). Each entry needs a reason and the condition
# that retires it; keep this list short.

# apache-airflow 2.11.2: code execution through unsafe deserialization of
# serialized DAGs. Fixed only in Airflow 3.3.0, which is a migration (DAG and
# REST API changes), not a bump. Exploiting it needs write access to the
# serialized DAG table or the DAGs folder, which only the operator should have.
# Remove when the image moves to Airflow 3.
CVE-2026-33264
